  _name: Ghost
  _description: Terafine creates "her" ghosts on the battlefield in which she can
    move, after moving the ghosts disappear.   Terafine can also apply "Life Drawing"
    through ghosts, thereby increasing the range of the ability.  Ghosts have 60
    health points, and they are also immune to physical damage. Ghosts take double
    damage from scattering spells. When an enemy passes through or is in a ghost,
    he has a 50% or 20% chance of getting a "Fear" debuff every 3 seconds if he passes
    nearby   "Once the commander of the Jaeger units, Terafine summons the souls
    of her soldiers who were killed by their commander."
  _icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d6d8c4724ba4c894a92eef1b6d27a08f, type: 3}
